    {
      "year": 2150,
      "event": "Genetic editing eliminates hereditary diseases.",
      "detail": "CRISPR-based technologies become widespread and affordable. Ethical boundaries blur as enhancements for intelligence and longevity emerge."
    },
    {
      "year": 2200,
