      "detail": "Mining operations harvest resources for orbital industries. Independent societies develop distinct cultural identities separate from Earth."
    },
    {
      "year": 2300,
      "event": "Human consciousness is digitally uploaded.",
      "detail": "Brain-emulation technology allows minds to exist in virtual environments. This sparks philosophical debates about identity and mortality."
    },
    {
      "year": 2400,
      "event": "Terraforming of Mars achieves breathable atmosphere.",
      "detail": "Engineered microorganisms release oxygen from regolith. Surface ecosystems begin to flourish, enabling large-scale human habitation."
    },
    {
      "year": 2500,
      "event": "Divergent human subspecies evolve off-Earth.",
      "detail": "Isolated colonies adapt physiologically to low-gravity environments. Genetic drift accelerates, creating variations incompatible with Earth's biosphere."
    },
    {
