      "event": "First interstellar probe reaches Alpha Centauri.",
      "detail": "AI-driven craft transmits data on exoplanets. Findings confirm Earth-like worlds, fueling ambitions for manned missions."
    },
    {
      "year": 2700,
      "event": "Resource wars fragment solar system governance.",
      "detail": "Conflicts erupt between Earth and outer colonies over asteroid minerals. Autonomous weapons cause catastrophic collateral damage."
    },
