      "event": "Humans merge with AI to form hybrid consciousness.",
      "detail": "Neural implants enable real-time cognition augmentation. Biological and synthetic intelligence become indistinguishable."
    },
    {
      "year": 3000,
      "event": "Generation ship departs for Proxima Centauri b.",
      "detail": "Multi-century voyage carries thousands of colonists. Ship ecosystems simulate Earth conditions to sustain descendants en route."
    },
    {
      "year": 3200,
      "event": "Gamma-ray burst sterilizes multiple star systems.",
      "detail": "A nearby stellar explosion irradiates colonies in the Orion Arm. Survivors develop radiation-resistant bioengineering."
    },
