  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "uncertain",
  "summary": "Humanity will likely evolve beyond biological form, spreading across galaxies while facing existential risks from wars, cosmic events, and technological hubris. Survival to 10000 CE depends on navigating these threats and adapting to a post-biological universe."
}
